{"steamAppId":2953840,"description":"You have escaped your cartoon! Play as the Doop Loops™ cereal mascot with one goal — collect as many loops as possible.\n\nThe problem? You're hopelessly addicted to the stuff, and the Cereal Protection Task Force will do anything to stop you.\n\nSoooooooo.... Chuck groceries the faces of competing cereal mascots and mall cops and KEEP COLLECTING YOUR LOOPS!!! IM LOOPY FOR DOOP LOOPS!!!\n\nWhat will you ever do with all these loops? Pay rent to a homeless man and unlock goofy skins!\n\nFEATURES\n1 homeless man you feed\n\n3+ hours of pure insanity\n\n5 epic boss fights with cutscenes and a quirky story\n\n15 unique store environments\n\n20+ types of chuckable merchandise\n\n40+ cosmetic combinations\n\n200+ voice lines\n\n∞ DOOP LOOPS™!!!\n\nEXTREMELY SATISFIED PLAYERS\n\n* Feedback from our GMTK Game Jam 2025 submission. Yes, this game was originally created for a game jam in just four days!\n\nUnsure if you want to buy the full game? Try the demo out first! :-)","short_description":"You are Loopy, a cereal mascot with a crazy cereal addiction! Beam mall cops and competing mascots with groceries, reclaim your cereal, and take down the bumbling Cereal Protection Task Force in this fast‑paced arcade action adventure!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/e57edfcbc2e5cc42aedba97e1aea32790a0b267f/header.jpg?t=1790047091","developer":"JakeHub, Metater","publisher":"Jatater Worldwide","genre":"Экшены, Казуальные игры, Инди","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":0,"releaseLabel":"3 дек. 2025 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":92,"steamReviewCount":13,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953840/55beaaed510f11cf5b469770f872073a706fca73/ss_55beaaed510f11cf5b469770f872073a706fca73.600x338.jpg?t=1790047091","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s